{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_tracing_otel_adapter_otel_adapter", "label": "OTel tracing adapter", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/tracing/otel-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_tracing_otel_adapter_oteltracer", "label": "otelTracer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/tracing/otel-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The production-grade tracer, and a function rather than a class: you hand it the OpenTelemetry API namespace and install the result on the tracing extension, after which the framework auto-spans flow to whatever backend the SDK exports to."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_tracing_otel_adapter_oteladapteroptions", "label": "OtelAdapterOptions", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/tracing/otel-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "withApi is mandatory: the adapter delegates to whatever you pass, and structural typing means the framework never imports the OpenTelemetry API itself. A pre-built tracer may be passed instead of a name and version."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_tracing_otel_adapter_otel_sampling", "label": "OTel sampling", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/tracing/otel-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sampling is configured on the SDK, not the adapter: the framework records spans at full rate and the SDK decides which to export, and unsampled spans still propagate context for correlation at zero backend cost. At high throughput always sample - 10 percent is typical and some teams go to 0.1 percent."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_tracing_otel_adapter_otel_exporters", "label": "OTel exporters", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/tracing/otel-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pick by the backend preferred protocol; OTLP over HTTP is the most general because it works with the Collector, which then routes anywhere."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_tracing_otel_adapter_otel_resource_attributes", "label": "OTel resource attributes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/tracing/otel-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Stamped on every span, and the most useful place for global context - service name, version, region, pod name."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_tracing_otel_adapter_no_otel_metrics_bridge", "label": "No OTel metrics bridge", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/tracing/otel-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The SDK ties traces, metrics and logs together via shared context, but the framework ships no OTel metrics bridge: use the Prometheus exporter, scraped into a Collector if you want it in an OTLP pipeline, or the prom-client adapter. For logs there is a bridge."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_tracing_otel_adapter_otellogger", "label": "otelLogger", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/tracing/otel-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The logging counterpart to otelTracer, with the same pass-in-the-namespace shape, emitting through the SDK LoggerProvider."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_tracing_otel_adapter_otel_version_alignment", "label": "OTel SDK version alignment", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/tracing/otel-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "OpenTelemetry SDK versions need to align - major-version mismatches break, so pin both to compatible majors."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_tracing_otel_adapter_otel_adapter", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_tracing_otel_adapter_oteltracer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/tracing/otel-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_tracing_otel_adapter_otel_adapter", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_tracing_otel_adapter_oteladapteroptions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/tracing/otel-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_tracing_otel_adapter_otel_adapter", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_tracing_otel_adapter_otel_sampling", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/tracing/otel-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_tracing_otel_adapter_otel_adapter", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_tracing_otel_adapter_otel_exporters", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/tracing/otel-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1